ShadowTest
├── shadowRootOf
│   ├── given the element has an open root
│   │   └── it returns that root
│   ├── given the element has a closed root
│   │   ├── given the extension API is available
│   │   │   └── it reaches the root through the API
│   │   ├── given it is attached to a plain element
│   │   │   └── it does not go looking
│   │   └── given the API is not available
│   │       └── it reports no root
│   ├── given the API throws
│   │   └── it reports no root rather than failing the walk
│   └── given the element hosts nothing
│       └── it reports no root
└── collectShadowRoots
    ├── given no shadow roots
    │   └── it finds nothing
    ├── given one shadow root
    │   └── it finds it
    ├── given the root element is itself a host
    │   └── it finds its shadow root
    ├── given a shadow root nested in another
    │   └── it finds both
    ├── given more roots than the limit
    │   └── it stops at the limit
    └── given the limit runs out before a nested root is reached
        └── it stops without descending into it
